  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"Monthly reported number of doses administered, 2012-2014 for Penta1, Penta3, OPV3\". The y-axis is reported number of doses administered (0 to 18000); the x-axis is year and month, January 2012 to December 2014. Penta 1 (blue) runs mostly between about 7000 and 10000 a month, with sharp peaks of about 16000 in December 2012 and about 12800 in August 2013; Penta 3 (red) follows a similar shape slightly lower, peaking at about 15000 in December 2012. OPV3 (green) tracks Penta 3 but peaks lower in December 2012 (about 10400) and has its own spike of about 9000 in January 2014, when the pentavalent doses are lower.",
